OL,3,GNEWSAArmy veteran gets first permanent
OL,4,Ahome in 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter spending more than 20 years
OL,7,Fliving in caravans and motorhomes, army
OL,8,Fveteran James Makinson said having a
OL,9,Fpermanent home gave him one thing:
OL,10,F"security".
OL,12,FKnown as Jimmy, the 79-year-old was
OL,13,Fhelped into accommodation in Wigan
OL,14,Fthrough Homes at Ease, a housing
OL,15,Fprogramme run by the not-for-profit
OL,16,Forganisation Armed Forces Community HQ.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
