OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArmy veteran gets first permanent
OL,4,Ahome in 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme helps veterans who are
OL,7,Fhomeless or at risk of losing their
OL,8,Fhomes find permanent accommodation
OL,9,Fthrough social housing providers and
OL,10,Fprivate landlords. Since 2023, it has
OL,11,Freceived more than 500 referrals across
OL,12,Fthe North West.
OL,14,F"I can't say enough about this place,"
OL,15,FMakinson said of Armed Forces Community
OL,16,FHQ, which helped him.
